    "KerNotch asks for nothing right now. Each permission is requested only when you turn on the feature that needs it, and only after KerNotch explains what it is about to ask for.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 2 body.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch asks for nothing right now. Each permission is requested only when you turn on the feature that needs it, and only after KerNotch explains what it is about to ask for."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch şu anda hiçbir şey istemiyor. Her izin, yalnızca ona gereksinim duyan özelliği açtığınızda ve yalnızca KerNotch ne isteyeceğini açıkladıktan sonra istenir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch fragt jetzt nach nichts. Jede Berechtigung wird erst angefragt, wenn du die Funktion einschaltest, die sie braucht — und erst, nachdem KerNotch erklärt hat, worum es geht."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch no pide nada ahora mismo. Cada permiso se solicita solo cuando activas la función que lo necesita, y solo después de que KerNotch explique qué va a pedir."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch ne demande rien pour l'instant. Chaque autorisation n'est demandée que lorsque vous activez la fonction qui en a besoin, et seulement après que KerNotch a expliqué ce qu'il va demander."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch non chiede nulla adesso. Ogni autorizzazione viene richiesta solo quando attivi la funzione che ne ha bisogno, e solo dopo che KerNotch ha spiegato cosa sta per chiedere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch asks macOS for each player separately, and only when you press the button.": {
      "comment": "Activities pane, Apple Events section caption.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch asks macOS for each player separately, and only when you press the button."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch her çalar için macOS'ten ayrı ayrı ve yalnızca düğmeye bastığınızda izin ister."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch fragt macOS für jeden Player einzeln — und nur, wenn du die Taste drückst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch pide permiso a macOS para cada reproductor por separado, y solo cuando pulsas el botón."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch interroge macOS pour chaque lecteur séparément, et uniquement quand vous appuyez sur le bouton."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch chiede a macOS per ogni player separatamente, e solo quando premi il pulsante."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch found configuration for the agents below. Turning one on here only records that you want it — nothing is written to any file. Installing the hook itself happens in Settings, where you see the exact snippet and approve the write.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 3 body, shown when detection found at least one agent.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch found configuration for the agents below. Turning one on here only records that you want it — nothing is written to any file. Installing the hook itself happens in Settings, where you see the exact snippet and approve the write."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch aşağıdaki araçlar için yapılandırma buldu. Burada birini açmak yalnızca onu istediğinizi kaydeder — hiçbir dosyaya yazılmaz. Kancanın kendisi, tam kod parçasını görüp yazmayı onayladığınız Ayarlar'dan kurulur."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch hat für die folgenden Agenten eine Konfiguration gefunden. Sie hier einzuschalten hält nur fest, dass du sie möchtest — es wird in keine Datei geschrieben. Der Hook selbst wird in den Einstellungen installiert, wo du das genaue Snippet siehst und das Schreiben freigibst."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch encontró configuración para los agentes de abajo. Activarlos aquí solo registra que los quieres: no se escribe nada en ningún archivo. El hook se instala en Ajustes, donde ves el fragmento exacto y apruebas la escritura."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch a trouvé une configuration pour les agents ci-dessous. Les activer ici ne fait qu'enregistrer votre choix : rien n'est écrit dans un fichier. L'installation du hook se fait dans les réglages, où vous voyez l'extrait exact et approuvez l'écriture."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch ha trovato la configurazione per gli agenti qui sotto. Attivarli qui registra solo la tua scelta: non viene scritto nulla su alcun file. L'installazione dell'hook avviene nelle impostazioni, dove vedi lo snippet esatto e approvi la scrittura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch has no Dock icon. Open the app again to show Settings when its menu bar icon is hidden.": {
      "comment": "General pane, Startup section caption.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch has no Dock icon. Open the app again to show Settings when its menu bar icon is hidden."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch'un Dock simgesi yoktur. Menü çubuğu simgesi gizliyken Ayarlar'ı göstermek için uygulamayı yeniden açın."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch hat kein Dock-Symbol. Öffne die App erneut, um die Einstellungen zu zeigen, wenn das Menüleistensymbol ausgeblendet ist."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch no tiene icono en el Dock. Vuelve a abrir la app para mostrar los ajustes cuando su icono de la barra de menús esté oculto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch n'a pas d'icône dans le Dock. Rouvrez l'app pour afficher les réglages lorsque son icône de barre des menus est masquée."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch non ha un'icona nel Dock. Riapri l'app per mostrare le impostazioni quando l'icona nella barra dei menu è nascosta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch lives in the menu bar. Everything you just saw — and everything you skipped — can be changed at any time in Settings.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 4 body.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch lives in the menu bar. Everything you just saw — and everything you skipped — can be changed at any time in Settings."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch menü çubuğunda yaşar. Az önce gördükleriniz — ve atladıklarınız — istediğiniz zaman Ayarlar'dan değiştirilebilir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch lebt in der Menüleiste. Alles, was du gerade gesehen hast — und alles, was du übersprungen hast — lässt sich jederzeit in den Einstellungen ändern."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch vive en la barra de menús. Todo lo que acabas de ver, y todo lo que te saltaste, puede cambiarse en cualquier momento en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch vit dans la barre des menus. Tout ce que vous venez de voir — et tout ce que vous avez passé — peut être modifié à tout moment dans les réglages."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch vive nella barra dei menu. Tutto ciò che hai appena visto — e tutto ciò che hai saltato — si può cambiare in qualsiasi momento nelle impostazioni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch shows nothing for an agent until you enable it here.": {
      "comment": "AI Integrations pane, Agents section caption.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch shows nothing for an agent until you enable it here."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch, bir aracıyı burada etkinleştirene dek onun için hiçbir şey göstermez."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch zeigt für einen Agenten nichts an, bis du ihn hier einschaltest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch no muestra nada de un agente hasta que lo actives aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch n'affiche rien pour un agent tant que vous ne l'activez pas ici."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch non mostra nulla di un agente finché non lo attivi qui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch turns the area around your notch into a live activity surface: what is playing, running timers, screen and audio recording indicators, charging state, and the status of your AI coding agents.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 1 body.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch turns the area around your notch into a live activity surface: what is playing, running timers, screen and audio recording indicators, charging state, and the status of your AI coding agents."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch, çentiğinizin çevresini canlı bir etkinlik yüzeyine dönüştürür: çalanlar, çalışan zamanlayıcılar, ekran ve ses kaydı göstergeleri, şarj durumu ve yapay zekâ kodlama aracılarınızın durumu."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch macht den Bereich um deine Notch zu einer lebendigen Aktivitätsfläche: aktuelle Wiedergabe, laufende Timer, Anzeigen für Bildschirm- und Audioaufnahme, Ladezustand und der Status deiner KI-Coding-Agenten."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch convierte la zona alrededor de la muesca en una superficie de actividad en vivo: lo que suena, los temporizadores, los indicadores de grabación de pantalla y micrófono, el estado de carga y el estado de tus agentes de programación con IA."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch transforme la zone autour de l'encoche en une surface d'activités en direct : la lecture en cours, les minuteurs, les indicateurs d'enregistrement d'écran et de micro, l'état de charge et le statut de vos agents de code IA."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch trasforma l'area attorno al notch in una superficie di attività dal vivo: cosa è in riproduzione, i timer attivi, gli indicatori di registrazione schermo e microfono, lo stato di carica e lo stato dei tuoi agenti di programmazione IA."
          }
        }
      }
    },
