    "KerNotch found configuration for the agents below. Turning one on approves installing its hook when setup finishes. Existing configuration is preserved with a backup before any change.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding agents step when configurations were detected.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch found configuration for the agents below. Turning one on approves installing its hook when setup finishes. Existing configuration is preserved with a backup before any change."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch aşağıdaki aracıların yapılandırmasını buldu. Birini açmanız, kurulum tamamlandığında hook'unun yüklenmesini onaylar. Herhangi bir değişiklikten önce mevcut yapılandırma yedeklenerek korunur."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch hat für die folgenden Agenten eine Konfiguration gefunden. Einen davon einzuschalten erlaubt, seinen Hook am Ende der Einrichtung zu installieren. Vorhandene Konfiguration bleibt erhalten und wird vor jeder Änderung gesichert."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch encontró configuración para los agentes de abajo. Activar uno aprueba instalar su hook al terminar la configuración. La configuración existente se conserva con una copia de seguridad antes de cualquier cambio."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch a trouvé une configuration pour les agents ci-dessous. En activer un autorise l'installation de son hook à la fin de la configuration. La configuration existante est conservée, avec une sauvegarde avant toute modification."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch ha trovato la configurazione per gli agenti qui sotto. Attivarne uno autorizza l'installazione del suo hook al termine della configurazione. La configurazione esistente viene conservata con un backup prima di ogni modifica."
          }
        }
      }
    },
